concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 After section 26B of the Principal Act the following section is"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "inserted:  Crimes Legislation Amendment No. 28, 1991 Members may be directed to perform certain staff member functions etc. \"26BA. The Commissioner may, at any time, in writing signed by the Commissioner, direct a member who is a commissioned police officer or a non-commissioned police officer to perform the specified functions and duties of a staff member during the period specified in the direction, or until the direction is revoked.\". Term of appointments" ;
