concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Section 12"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "Section 26D of the Principal Act is amended by omitting subsection (4) and substituting the following subsection: \"(4) Where: (a) a person's appointment ends under section 26E; and (b) the person is re-appointed for a term starting immediately after the end of that appointment; the person's service is taken to be continuous.\". Undertakings and oaths or affirmations" ;
    skos:definition "Section 26D of the Principal Act is amended by omitting subsection (4) and substituting the following subsection: \"(4) Where: (a) a person's appointment ends under section 26E; and (b) the person is re-appointed for a term starting immediately after the end of that appointment; the person's service is taken to be continuous.\". Undertakings and oaths or affirmations"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "86914c13d93210121f9b1951d18ea503d37752097cb8dc4afd00c6a931e3d72d" ;
