concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 After section 35 of the Principal Act the following section is"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "inserted: Transfers \"35A. Where a person is transferred, the person's appointment does not end, but is, on and after the day when the transfer takes effect, taken to be an appointment to the position within the rank, or at the level, to which the person is transferred.\". Promotion" ;
