concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-1991-sec-41 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41 Section 41"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41 ;
    values:originalText "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended: (a) by inserting in subsection (1) the following definition: \" 'Associate Director' means the Associate Director of Public Prosecutions;\"; (b) by omitting paragraph (4) (a) and substituting the following paragraphs: \"(a) the Associate Director; or (aa) a member of the staff mentioned in subsection 27 (1); or (ab) a person employed under subsection 27 (3); or\".  Crimes Legislation Amendment No. 28, 1991 Office of the Director of Public Prosecutions" ;
    skos:definition "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended: (a) by inserting in subsection (1) the following definition: \" 'Associate Director' means the Associate Director of Public Prosecutions;\"; (b) by omitting paragraph (4) (a) and substituting the following paragraphs: \"(a) the Associate Director; or (aa) a member of the staff mentioned in subsection 27 (1); or (ab) a person employed under subsection 27 (3); or\".  Crimes Legislation Amendment No. 28, 1991 Office of the Director of Public Prosecutions"@en ;
