    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-47 ;
    values:originalText "Section 20 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the following subsection: \"(2) The Director may grant the Associate Director leave of absence from duty on the terms and conditions, as to remuneration or otherwise, determined by the Director.\". Resignation" ;
