    skos:prefLabel "50 Section 50"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-50 ;
    values:originalText "Section 23 of the Principal Act is amended: (a) by inserting in subsection (1) \"or Associate Director\" after \"Director\"; (b) by omitting from subsection (2) \"If the Director—\" and substituting \"If the Director or Associate Director:\"; (c) by omitting from paragraph (2) (b) \"by the Attorney-General\" and substituting \"under section 20\"; (d) by adding at the end of subsection (2) \"or Associate Director, as the case may be\". Disclosure of interests" ;
    skos:definition "Section 23 of the Principal Act is amended: (a) by inserting in subsection (1) \"or Associate Director\" after \"Director\"; (b) by omitting from subsection (2) \"If the Director—\" and substituting \"If the Director or Associate Director:\"; (c) by omitting from paragraph (2) (b) \"by the Attorney-General\" and substituting \"under section 20\"; (d) by adding at the end of subsection (2) \"or Associate Director, as the case may be\". Disclosure of interests"@en ;
